# The crash case on the device: phone-shell runs as a systemd service with an
# fd store (selftest-boot.sh starts it with systemd-run), crashes on purpose,
# and the instance systemd restarts takes the apps over from LISTEN_FDS.

sleep 800

== Shell 崩溃：systemd 从 fd 存储把应用连接交给重启的 Shell，应用不重启
require-fdstore
at sys.idle 8000
key f4
type /
type 计算器
key enter
wait 小数点
type 58
wait 58
app-pid com.phone.calc save
shell-crash
at sys.idle 15000
app-pid com.phone.calc same
adopted com.phone.calc
key f4
type /
type 计算器
key enter
wait 58
key f4

== Shell 崩溃后应用仍在它自己的 systemd 作用域里，限额照旧，冻结照常
require-cgroup
cgroup com.phone.calc memory.max 201326592
cgroup com.phone.calc pids.max 128
freeze-after 500
key f4
appstate com.phone.calc frozen 5000
cgroup com.phone.calc cgroup.freeze 1
freeze-after 0
